# CR 118.4/601.2h: a single-colour Phyrexian shard ({W/P}) paid with the
# mana itself -- ChoosePayPhyrexian true -- costs no life at all, unlike
# mana-payment-phyrexian-life's own false branch.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19); the
# lands are tapped there, since a pool loaded by setup.state empties as the
# steps pass (CR 500.4).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 W
queue payphyrexian true
paymanacost human W/P
